</section>
<section class="cs__sec">
  <h2 class="cs__h">Pricing, subscription and product access</h2>
  <p class="cs__p">
    Plans in SumoSum are based on the number of projects, so I put the allowance where people use
    it: the project list shows the current plan and how many project slots are left, with a link to
    manage it.
  </p>
  <p class="cs__p">
    Billing Information shows the current plan, renewal date and extra project slots beside a
    billing summary that adds them up. Changing plans opens a confirmation that compares the project
    count now and after the change, and warns clearly before anything would be lost. I also
    designed flows for buying and removing extra project slots, and for upgrading or downgrading.
  </p>
  <figure class="cs__fig">
    <img
      src="{{ '/assets/images/projects/sumosum-billing.webp' | rel }}"
