      height="874"
      alt="Billing Information page with Payment and Billing tabs selected. A Current Plan card lists plan, frequency, project limit, purchase and renewal dates and extra projects. A Billing Summary card itemises the plan and additional project slots and shows the next billing total. A Change Plan button sits below."
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <figcaption>Billing: what you have, what it costs, and how to change it.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <p class="cs__p">
    On the admin side, the team manages plans in one table with price, project allowance,
    subscriber count, status and an on/off toggle. Admins can create and edit plans and add-ons,
    such as extra projects, from the same panel.
  </p>
